USER STORIES

US1: Extending a Stay
As a guest with an active booking, I want to extend my stay from the app so that I don’t have to call the front desk or make a new booking.
Acceptance criteria:
Given I have an active booking more than 24 hours before check-out when I open the extension option, then I see whether my current room is available and the price per extra night and total cost.
When I confirm the extension, the system re-checks availability and if the room is still free, it updates my booking and shows a confirmation with the new check-out date and total price.
I can complete the extension in no more than 3 steps from the booking page or notification.
US2: Timely Reminders
As a guest, I want to be reminded before my check-out date so that I have time to decide whether to extend.
Acceptance criteria:
For stays longer than 3 days, I receive notifications 7 days and 3 days before check-out. For shorter stays, I receive one notification 48 hours before check-out.
Each notification contains a link that takes me directly to the extension option.
I can view and turn off reminders in my notification settings.
US3: Handling an Unavailable Room
As a guest, I want to be offered other options when my room isn’t available so that I’m not stuck at a dead end.
Acceptance criteria:
When my current room is unavailable for the requested extension, the app suggests at least one alternative, such as a different room type or a nearby date.
If the price or availability changes between viewing and confirming, the app tells me what changed in details according to my purchase
If my connection drops during confirmation, the app shows my actual booking status when I reconnect and I am never charged without an updated booking.
